WEBVTT

00:01.575 --> 00:02.912
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.936 --> 00:04.271
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.295 --> 00:07.511
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.535 --> 00:13.095
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.095 --> 01:31.055
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.215 --> 01:34.455
=Episode 38=

02:37.435 --> 02:38.435
Hold it.

02:59.555 --> 03:00.555
We've got a message?

03:06.580 --> 03:08.105
Guangling Army organized an attack.

03:08.480 --> 03:10.256
Li Chungang walked out of the carriage,

03:10.280 --> 03:11.680
and waved the sword across the sky.

03:11.705 --> 03:12.785
And then what?

03:21.405 --> 03:23.055
How many soldiers did Zhao Yi send?

03:24.680 --> 03:25.680
More than two thousand.

03:27.805 --> 03:29.235
Only Li Chungang and his sword?

03:30.980 --> 03:32.220
Only Li Chungang and his sword.

03:32.505 --> 03:35.055
No one ever dared to get in the way.

03:35.255 --> 03:36.655
The carriage advanced to the north.

03:37.305 --> 03:38.475
Amazing.

03:39.205 --> 03:40.230
What about Xu Fengnian?

03:40.305 --> 03:41.310
Did he show himself?

03:43.155 --> 03:45.211
Since Li Chungang was in the carriage,

03:45.235 --> 03:46.855
I'm sure Xu Fengnian was, too.

03:47.195 --> 03:48.855
And it doesn't matter even if he wasn't.

03:49.955 --> 03:51.705
I'm traveling to the west with you.

03:52.255 --> 03:53.695
As long as Li Chungang doesn't come,

03:54.080 --> 03:55.280
no one can stop you.

03:56.530 --> 03:57.980
Then I feel secure.

03:59.680 --> 04:01.155
I haven't had

04:01.480 --> 04:03.255
a good sleep for ages.

04:04.305 --> 04:05.105
Grand Master,

04:05.255 --> 04:06.430
let's set off.

04:06.755 --> 04:08.080
I can't wait

04:08.330 --> 04:09.595
to go to West Shu.

04:10.480 --> 04:11.480
Okay.

04:16.855 --> 04:17.855
Wake up!

04:58.580 --> 04:59.315
Grand Master,

04:59.355 --> 05:00.630
why do we get off the horses?

05:01.555 --> 05:02.705
The horses

05:03.280 --> 05:04.855
would draw too much attention.

05:06.075 --> 05:07.180
We'll be traveling

05:08.805 --> 05:09.880
by water.

05:10.130 --> 05:11.180
It's safer.

05:34.055 --> 05:35.055
We'll go on board

05:35.355 --> 05:36.355
over there.

05:37.005 --> 05:37.932
For the rest of the journey,

05:37.956 --> 05:39.205
we'll let the current take us.

05:39.605 --> 05:41.956
We were sometimes slow, sometimes fast,
and we've been changing courses.

05:41.980 --> 05:42.830
Grand Master,

05:42.930 --> 05:44.581
I don't think it's necessary
to be so careful.

05:44.605 --> 05:46.480
No one can catch up with us anymore.

06:47.855 --> 06:49.180
Xu Fengnian?

06:50.730 --> 06:51.730
How is it possible?

07:04.275 --> 07:05.355
How is it possible?

07:07.805 --> 07:09.291
Do you remember

07:09.315 --> 07:10.595
what I said to you in Wudi City?

07:13.630 --> 07:15.456
Why would you save me?

07:15.480 --> 07:17.171
You shouldn't die here.

07:17.195 --> 07:18.230
Why don't you run?

07:20.830 --> 07:21.915
You weren't supposed

07:22.480 --> 07:23.755
to die in Wudi City,

07:25.730 --> 07:26.980
but here.

07:27.655 --> 07:28.905
You saved me in Wudi City

07:29.795 --> 07:31.505
in order to take my life here?

07:32.515 --> 07:33.481
It doesn't make sense, does it?

07:33.505 --> 07:34.251
Whether I save you

07:34.275 --> 07:35.275
or kill you,

07:35.530 --> 07:36.780
it isn't about you.

07:37.155 --> 07:38.505
The person I regard as an enemy

07:39.555 --> 07:41.255
has never been you.

07:43.230 --> 07:44.655
You've been expecting me.

07:47.880 --> 07:49.805
On the day my mother got assassinated,

07:51.680 --> 07:53.305
where were you?

07:53.880 --> 07:55.480
Xu Xiao should have had
an investigation.

07:56.355 --> 07:57.506
I was ordered to a mission outside.

07:57.530 --> 07:58.531
I wasn't in the capital city.

07:58.555 --> 08:00.005
I checked the order.

08:01.405 --> 08:02.491
And I had my men

08:02.515 --> 08:03.805
question everyone

08:04.605 --> 08:05.605
who was still alive.

08:06.080 --> 08:07.305
Han Diaosi,

08:09.080 --> 08:10.630
on the day my mother was assassinated,

08:11.755 --> 08:13.330
you returned to the capital city.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.855
So

08:19.530 --> 08:20.930
Someone saw me.

08:21.130 --> 08:22.281
Yes, someone saw you,

08:22.305 --> 08:23.305
yet he didn't know you.

08:23.505 --> 08:24.505
But that's okay.

08:25.405 --> 08:26.875
Your look is easy to recognize.

08:27.255 --> 08:28.371
Are you sure you got the right person?

08:28.395 --> 08:29.955
I was 90 percent sure,

08:29.995 --> 08:31.355
but after my journey to Wudi City,

08:32.130 --> 08:34.105
I was given a confirmation.

08:34.730 --> 08:35.805
Was this person

08:36.455 --> 08:38.255
in the capital that day?

08:45.255 --> 08:46.505
(Han Diaosi) Yes.

08:47.530 --> 08:48.830
You were in the capital city.

08:49.505 --> 08:50.595
Why?

08:51.880 --> 08:53.611
Because the royal family's
assassination on my mother

08:53.635 --> 08:54.412
needed you,

08:54.436 --> 08:56.006
the best martial artist
of the imperial palace.

08:56.030 --> 08:58.505
However, you were afraid
of the revenge from North Liang,

08:58.915 --> 09:01.180
so they gave the fake order.

09:01.530 --> 09:02.855
Who would have thought

09:03.280 --> 09:05.315
that my mother managed to escape?

09:07.055 --> 09:09.530
You were scared during that period
of time, weren't you?

09:10.805 --> 09:13.285
You were scared that North Liang
would attack the capital city.

09:14.580 --> 09:15.835
But it never happened.

09:16.430 --> 09:19.230
Because my mother didn't disclose it.

09:19.680 --> 09:20.680
Why?

09:20.930 --> 09:22.430
Because the country was just founded,

09:22.530 --> 09:24.155
if there was another war,

09:24.275 --> 09:25.955
it would cause another turmoil.

09:26.030 --> 09:27.286
Life would be in distress,

09:27.310 --> 09:28.750
and the damage would be unamendable.

09:28.955 --> 09:30.395
For the people across the country,

09:31.755 --> 09:33.330
my mother kept it to herself.

09:33.655 --> 09:34.980
She was a great woman.

09:35.380 --> 09:38.180
But did you ever care
about the greater good?

09:39.855 --> 09:41.435
North Liang was tough,

09:41.630 --> 09:44.080
any ruler would be concerned.

09:48.780 --> 09:50.305
So you admit it.

09:52.305 --> 09:53.635
Now that we've come this far,

09:54.180 --> 09:55.631
it would be indecent of me
if I kept denying it.

09:55.655 --> 09:56.655
Yes.

09:56.755 --> 09:58.131
I admit that I participated

09:58.155 --> 09:59.555
in the attack on your mother.

10:02.780 --> 10:03.835
Good.

10:05.315 --> 10:07.105
The son exceeds the father.

10:10.235 --> 10:11.830
What Xu Xiao failed to figure out,

10:12.355 --> 10:13.680
you have done it.

10:18.155 --> 10:20.105
You seriously underestimated Xu Xiao.

10:21.755 --> 10:23.475
With all that he experienced
over the years,

10:23.705 --> 10:25.745
I don't believe
that he was never suspicious of you.

10:26.830 --> 10:28.675
But he never sought revenge.

10:29.080 --> 10:31.256
Because the peace of the country

10:31.280 --> 10:33.000
cost numerous lives
of North Liang soldiers.

10:33.455 --> 10:35.035
He didn't dare to start a war

10:35.305 --> 10:36.306
for a personal vendetta

10:36.330 --> 10:37.795
that would set the country in chaos.

10:38.455 --> 10:39.691
He didn't want to be guilty

10:39.715 --> 10:41.580
of failing his dead brothers-in-arms!

10:43.180 --> 10:45.660
The Lord of North Liang
had given priority to the greater good.

10:47.680 --> 10:49.655
But I'm different from Xu Xiao.

10:52.305 --> 10:53.515
How can I not

10:53.755 --> 10:54.930
avenge my mother?

10:55.805 --> 10:57.891
Why would the innocent abide

10:57.915 --> 10:59.305
and make compromises?

11:00.330 --> 11:01.755
I, Xu Fengnian,

11:02.455 --> 11:03.955
won't put up with the grievances.

11:06.355 --> 11:07.355
So

11:08.180 --> 11:10.331
You'd rather ruin the peace

11:10.355 --> 11:11.980
that the ancestors built?

11:13.105 --> 11:14.105
I told you

11:14.230 --> 11:15.730
that I'm different from Xu Xiao.

11:16.205 --> 11:17.635
I demand individual justice

11:17.795 --> 11:19.605
and public fairness.

11:20.130 --> 11:21.980
Why must I choose one over the other?

11:22.480 --> 11:23.995
I want both,

11:24.230 --> 11:25.830
and this is
what my heart tells me to do.

11:28.835 --> 11:30.355
Now that I think about it,

11:30.795 --> 11:32.291
Cao Changqing's blatant journey

11:32.315 --> 11:34.205
to West Shu

11:34.805 --> 11:36.830
was to cooperate with you.

11:38.580 --> 11:40.030
But something

11:40.730 --> 11:42.905
has been puzzling me.

11:43.480 --> 11:44.452
How do you know

11:44.476 --> 11:46.771
that the imperial palace
had to send Zhao Kai to West Shu

11:46.795 --> 11:48.605
and that it would be me

11:48.755 --> 11:50.155
escorting him?

11:50.605 --> 11:51.681
The weirdest thing is,

11:51.705 --> 11:52.731
during our journey,

11:52.755 --> 11:54.595
we've been constantly changing courses,

11:54.875 --> 11:56.730
how come you get in our way right here?

11:57.830 --> 11:59.255
Obviously, someone

11:59.780 --> 12:01.355
tipped him off.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.230
It was you.

12:19.880 --> 12:21.571
You serve North Liang?

12:21.595 --> 12:22.730
Of course not.

12:23.080 --> 12:24.581
His identity

12:24.605 --> 12:26.430
is the answer to all of your questions.

12:26.930 --> 12:27.852
You want to know why I knew

12:27.876 --> 12:29.916
the imperial palace would
send Zhao Kai to West Shu?

12:30.505 --> 12:31.891
Well, someone in the imperial palace

12:31.915 --> 12:33.880
helped me lead things in that direction.

12:34.305 --> 12:35.230
In the meantime,

12:35.305 --> 12:37.030
he kept the communication with me.

12:39.555 --> 12:41.055
Who do you work for?

12:41.930 --> 12:43.680
Can't you see that I use a blade?

12:47.505 --> 12:48.605
Gu Jiantang?

12:49.230 --> 12:50.530
General Gu's sickness

12:50.780 --> 12:52.230
occurred in time, right?

12:54.155 --> 12:55.155
Impossible.

12:56.880 --> 12:59.105
Why would Gu Jiantang
work with North Liang?

12:59.980 --> 13:01.595
Because as long as I'm alive,

13:01.905 --> 13:03.771
you will leave all the opportunities

13:03.795 --> 13:04.795
to me.

13:05.330 --> 13:06.480
While you're around,

13:06.780 --> 13:09.180
Gu Jiantang won't be allowed
to leave the capital city.

13:09.880 --> 13:11.655
The tiger can't return to the mountain.

13:12.475 --> 13:14.055
He's always begrudging.

13:15.475 --> 13:16.680
Even if I was dead,

13:17.380 --> 13:19.755
His Majesty wouldn't
let him leave the capital city.

13:21.005 --> 13:22.635
But fewer obstacles,

13:23.730 --> 13:25.605
more hope.

13:25.930 --> 13:27.180
Good point.

13:28.105 --> 13:29.680
Since you work for Gu Jiantang,

13:29.780 --> 13:31.980
why do you serve as a retainer
of the Xuanyuan Family?

13:33.955 --> 13:35.430
I asked a dumb question, didn't I?

13:36.080 --> 13:38.051
The Xuanyuan Family controls
the waterways of the world.

13:38.075 --> 13:39.755
How convenient is that?

13:40.080 --> 13:42.480
General Gu can naturally see it.

13:42.680 --> 13:44.171
To General Gu,

13:44.195 --> 13:46.115
I'm nobody.

13:46.680 --> 13:48.115
I was ordered

13:48.555 --> 13:49.681
to serve under the Xuanyuan Family,

13:49.705 --> 13:51.865
at the same time,
I made this choice for my own future.

13:52.030 --> 13:53.251
Too bad,

13:53.275 --> 13:55.080
His Highness acted faster.

13:55.655 --> 13:57.135
When you were in the Xuanyuan Family,

13:57.255 --> 13:58.855
you started to work with Xu Fengnian?

13:59.405 --> 14:00.580
No.

14:01.505 --> 14:02.971
General Gu couldn't have predicted

14:02.995 --> 14:04.881
that His Highness would interfere
with the Xuanyuan Family's business.

14:04.905 --> 14:07.051
I started to work
with His Highness afterwards.

14:07.075 --> 14:08.581
You couldn't have time to take orders.

14:08.605 --> 14:09.605
Also,

14:09.680 --> 14:11.035
you didn't have any chance

14:11.280 --> 14:12.880
to make acquaintance with Xu Fengnian...

14:18.195 --> 14:19.805
Shangyin Academy.

14:20.480 --> 14:22.075
Keep an eye on Xu Fengnian.

14:22.330 --> 14:24.091
It would be the best
if you can hear what he says.

14:24.115 --> 14:25.155
If you can't,

14:26.030 --> 14:27.205
it's okay.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.080
Yes.

14:32.755 --> 14:34.915
I gave you the chance.

14:35.330 --> 14:37.291
General Gu attached
importance to Shangyin Academy,

14:37.315 --> 14:38.875
so he certainly had left his men there.

14:39.155 --> 14:40.555
And I was given the order.

14:40.805 --> 14:42.630
Good effort for General Gu.

14:43.730 --> 14:45.255
I still remember

14:46.030 --> 14:47.805
how you replied to me.

14:48.355 --> 14:49.830
Where have Xu Fengnian

14:50.180 --> 14:51.355
and my wife been?

14:51.955 --> 14:53.205
They were talking in the room.

14:53.630 --> 14:55.181
I dare not get too close
and eavesdrop on them.

14:55.205 --> 14:56.835
Did Xu Fengnian come out

14:57.405 --> 14:59.045
when I was meeting Sword God Li?

14:59.380 --> 15:00.380
Absolutely no.

15:00.880 --> 15:02.915
You started to lie to me from that time.

15:03.530 --> 15:04.755
I apologize,

15:05.405 --> 15:07.580
but you got in General Gu's way.

15:09.180 --> 15:09.932
Who is it?

15:09.956 --> 15:11.155
Yuan Tingshan.

15:16.880 --> 15:18.275
General Gu wished to ask you

15:19.005 --> 15:20.891
if you know that Han Diaosi
was actually in the capital city

15:20.915 --> 15:22.715
on the night Her Grace was attacked?

15:23.205 --> 15:24.205
I know.

15:24.655 --> 15:26.715
I also know what General Gu wants.

15:29.530 --> 15:30.530
We can talk about it.

15:39.705 --> 15:42.315
Now I have pretty much
figured it all out.

15:42.705 --> 15:44.875
Instead of being a hindrance,

15:45.380 --> 15:47.030
Gu Jiantang actually facilitated

15:47.755 --> 15:50.255
Zhao Kai's journey to West Shu.

15:51.555 --> 15:54.430
And this person had been
tipping you off along the way,

15:56.630 --> 15:58.355
so you showed up here.

15:59.230 --> 16:00.275
In this case,

16:00.955 --> 16:02.955
the Princess of West Chu
is one of your pawns, too.

16:03.380 --> 16:04.835
Jiang Ni isn't a pawn.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.035
Even without Jiang Ni,

16:07.405 --> 16:09.395
I could still lure you
out of the capital city.

16:10.180 --> 16:11.180
And coincidentally,

16:11.455 --> 16:12.830
I ran into Cao Changqing.

16:14.130 --> 16:16.355
Also, it happened
that Gu Jiantang wanted you dead, too.

16:16.480 --> 16:18.630
It saved my arrangements
in the capital city,

16:18.880 --> 16:20.105
which could be for future use.

16:24.980 --> 16:26.755
A good plot.

16:27.030 --> 16:28.055
Too bad,

16:28.730 --> 16:30.555
Gu Jiantang couldn't be here in person.

16:31.530 --> 16:32.780
I won't chat with you.

16:33.105 --> 16:34.180
Let's get on board.

16:57.005 --> 16:58.435
This is our ship.

16:59.055 --> 17:00.280
You get on board first.

17:08.930 --> 17:10.055
You came, too.

17:17.980 --> 17:19.155
Cross the river in that way.

17:33.480 --> 17:34.680
Xu Longxiang.

17:35.405 --> 17:36.805
All four of them have arrived.

17:45.455 --> 17:46.735
Though I'm not a martial artist,

17:47.755 --> 17:49.555
I can't miss

17:50.255 --> 17:51.715
the scene of revenging for Mother.

18:03.105 --> 18:04.755
No wonder you helped
the Xuanyuan Family.

18:05.355 --> 18:07.011
To gather everybody
from all corners of the country,

18:07.035 --> 18:09.171
only the Xuanyuan Family
who controls the waterways

18:09.195 --> 18:10.406
can pull it off.

18:10.430 --> 18:11.331
Jiangnan,

18:11.355 --> 18:12.107
the Academy,

18:12.131 --> 18:13.855
Mount Longhu, and the Xuanyuan Family.

18:14.280 --> 18:16.115
Every stop of yours

18:16.305 --> 18:18.130
was part of your preparation for today.

18:18.855 --> 18:20.655
You have no way to escape.

18:23.205 --> 18:24.930
The four of you

18:25.655 --> 18:27.115
wish to kill me?

18:27.505 --> 18:29.480
Not just the four of us.

18:29.680 --> 18:32.315
You transferred soldiers
from North Liang?

18:32.555 --> 18:33.805
Xu Fengnian,

18:34.130 --> 18:36.280
my eyes are always on North Liang.

18:36.555 --> 18:38.331
Among all Xu Xiao's adopted sons,

18:38.355 --> 18:41.275
only Chu Lushan follows your command.

18:41.530 --> 18:43.675
Chu Lushan didn't make any move.

18:43.930 --> 18:45.930
He's still in North Liang.

18:46.355 --> 18:47.995
Where do you get any reinforcements?

19:02.230 --> 19:03.405
Chen Zhibao.

19:04.730 --> 19:06.995
Your relationship is the worst.

19:08.005 --> 19:09.230
Why him?

19:39.880 --> 19:40.880
I didn't come here

19:41.305 --> 19:42.675
to aid Xu Fengnian.

19:43.355 --> 19:45.855
I came to avenge my adoptive mother.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.530
We try to fight our way out.

20:00.630 --> 20:01.775
Don't wait for me.

20:02.130 --> 20:03.205
Rush to Shu.

20:13.505 --> 20:14.880
Charge, North Liang riders!

20:23.705 --> 20:24.805
These people

20:25.980 --> 20:27.155
are far from enough.

20:33.180 --> 20:34.505
Be careful, Grand Master.

21:36.080 --> 21:37.080
I didn't expect

21:37.805 --> 21:39.205
that it would end up

21:39.405 --> 21:41.325
as an internecine fight
between husband and wife.

21:43.515 --> 21:44.930
I'm not your wife.

24:25.630 --> 24:27.195
A born Diamond Realm.

24:29.680 --> 24:31.405
Sadly, such a prodigy

24:33.180 --> 24:34.955
shall fall on this day.

24:47.830 --> 24:48.481
Cross the river.

24:48.505 --> 24:49.505
Yes.

25:34.730 --> 25:36.170
You didn't lose the blades, did you?

26:37.195 --> 26:38.455
Go for the boss.

26:43.280 --> 26:44.680
Snakes in Sleeves.

27:20.605 --> 27:21.855
What is Heaven's Mandate?

27:22.205 --> 27:23.411
The one who passes the Heaven's Gate

27:23.435 --> 27:24.755
overtops all common men.

27:25.130 --> 27:26.380
I, however, am in defiance.

27:26.655 --> 27:28.331
Of how the Heaven's Way
determines one's life

27:28.355 --> 27:29.411
and fate is not to be fought against.

27:29.435 --> 27:30.571
Of men being subject to Heaven.

27:30.595 --> 27:31.611
Of celestials being immortals.

27:31.635 --> 27:32.811
Only the sword in my hand

27:32.835 --> 27:34.005
cuts open the Heaven's Gate.

27:34.280 --> 27:35.012
Now you understand

27:35.036 --> 27:36.580
what Open the Heaven's Gate is, right?

27:37.080 --> 27:38.280
Cut off the Heaven's Mandate,

27:38.380 --> 27:39.655
cut off the fetters.

27:39.880 --> 27:41.091
This thought

27:41.115 --> 27:43.605
is the soul of Open the Heaven's Gate.

27:50.530 --> 27:52.755
Open the Heaven's Gate!

27:57.080 --> 27:58.230
Fengnian.

28:20.505 --> 28:22.355
No need to be a death guard, huh?

28:44.155 --> 28:45.255
Your Highness!

28:52.080 --> 28:52.731
Fengnian!

28:52.755 --> 28:53.755
Brother!

28:58.555 --> 28:59.730
Go to hell!

29:05.255 --> 29:06.855
Dahuangting.

29:13.430 --> 29:15.555
Snakes in Sleeves.

29:40.105 --> 29:41.430
Be careful, Grand Master!

30:13.530 --> 30:14.611
Deng Tai'e.

30:14.635 --> 30:16.255
And the swords
that Senior Li lent to me.

30:17.780 --> 30:19.155
I'll lend this to you.

30:19.255 --> 30:20.212
The next time you open the box

30:20.236 --> 30:21.731
with the Heart Arts
of Snakes in Sleeves,

30:21.755 --> 30:23.355
you have one shot to cast flying swords.

30:24.930 --> 30:26.530
If it weren't for Li Chungang

30:27.830 --> 30:29.755
and Deng Tai'e's Sword Intent,

30:29.855 --> 30:31.335
this one attack alone

30:31.855 --> 30:33.905
wouldn't be able to kill me.

30:36.905 --> 30:38.805
Who else attacked my mother?

30:58.455 --> 30:59.635
Grand Master.

31:03.780 --> 31:05.515
Father doesn't want to see me?

31:06.980 --> 31:08.456
It isn't important

31:08.480 --> 31:09.680
if he wants to see you or not.

31:10.180 --> 31:11.315
You need to fight

31:11.855 --> 31:13.395
for what you desire.

31:14.080 --> 31:16.081
(Zhao Kai in his childhood)
Even if it'll be the end of you,

31:16.105 --> 31:18.755
you have to fight to earn
a glimmer of hope for yourself.

31:22.655 --> 31:24.005
How do I fight to earn it?

31:24.680 --> 31:25.705
I'll teach you.

31:44.230 --> 31:45.505
Xu Fengnian.

31:51.655 --> 31:53.995
You were born the heir apparent
of the Xu family.

31:56.280 --> 31:59.205
Everything is ready for you on a plate.

31:59.830 --> 32:00.915
However, I

32:01.330 --> 32:03.355
have to try the best I can

32:04.880 --> 32:07.805
to earn the slightest chance.

32:10.805 --> 32:11.805
I understand

32:12.705 --> 32:13.955
that you hate me very much.

32:19.830 --> 32:21.190
I don't hate you.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.855
But I also refuse to yield to destiny.

32:32.105 --> 32:34.205
So I try to change it!

32:39.555 --> 32:43.315
Even though the change
has brought me to this day,

32:44.155 --> 32:45.730
to this moment,

32:49.905 --> 32:51.905
I don't regret it.

32:56.955 --> 32:58.505
The same for you.

33:00.030 --> 33:01.480
You are the one

33:02.155 --> 33:03.451
who found the slightest chance
of avenging your mother

33:03.475 --> 33:05.630
against all odds.

33:09.605 --> 33:10.755
Xu Fengnian.

33:13.755 --> 33:14.755
You are

33:16.230 --> 33:17.715
marvelous.

33:24.905 --> 33:27.155
But I never intended to start a war

33:27.255 --> 33:28.595
for my own satisfaction.

33:30.155 --> 33:31.155
Zhao Kai,

33:31.955 --> 33:33.035
this is the reason

33:33.655 --> 33:34.880
why you end in this way.

33:55.530 --> 33:57.155
I admit defeat.

33:59.755 --> 34:01.075
Xu Fengnian.

34:04.630 --> 34:06.655
You're better than me.

35:19.680 --> 35:20.805
Don't drop them again.

35:34.030 --> 35:35.956
General Gu asked me
to express his gratitude to you.

35:35.980 --> 35:37.840
Our cooperation ends here.

35:38.405 --> 35:40.530
Hope we won't encounter in battle.

35:47.980 --> 35:50.405
This should be the last time
I work with you.

35:52.105 --> 35:53.380
Who knows?

35:55.880 --> 35:57.005
Return to North Liang!

36:07.930 --> 36:08.930
Fengnian!

36:25.780 --> 36:27.075
I have a feeling

36:27.830 --> 36:29.980
that he'll never see you
as the Lord of North Liang.

36:34.805 --> 36:35.805
Come home with me.

36:42.105 --> 36:43.675
We have to return to our homes.

36:44.380 --> 36:46.305
If we follow you back to North Liang,

36:46.630 --> 36:47.971
it's like we're telling the whole world

36:47.995 --> 36:49.755
that we killed Han Diaosi and Zhao Kai.

36:57.755 --> 36:59.355
When you become the Lord of North Liang,

37:00.105 --> 37:01.555
we'll be able to go home.

37:05.780 --> 37:06.860
Practice your blade skills.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.530
Honor the Xu family.

37:11.055 --> 37:12.055
Brother,

37:12.105 --> 37:13.705
I'll save some hawthorn berries for you.

37:19.955 --> 37:21.255
When I'm back in North Liang,

37:22.005 --> 37:23.765
I'll have to take another trip
to North Mang.

37:24.355 --> 37:25.611
The clues about the other assailants

37:25.635 --> 37:27.035
are somewhere on that land.

37:28.655 --> 37:30.355
When I complete the real revenge,

37:31.855 --> 37:32.855
I'll come back

37:34.155 --> 37:35.280
to get you all home.

39:38.380 --> 39:39.380
Thanks.

39:42.255 --> 39:43.255
I'm off.

39:43.680 --> 39:44.680
Where are you going?

39:45.305 --> 39:46.905
There are some books
that I need to read.

39:47.130 --> 39:48.730
I have to rush back
to Tingchao Pavilion.

39:51.805 --> 39:52.905
See you in North Liang.

41:21.755 --> 41:23.005
If I am to go to North Mang,

41:23.430 --> 41:25.590
I'll need to learn
how to cast flying swords on my own.

41:27.780 --> 41:30.181
Didn't you sense the Sword Heart
that Deng Tai'e left?

41:30.205 --> 41:31.630
It wouldn't be that easy.

41:32.530 --> 41:34.630
But I don't need
to think about that for now.

41:35.730 --> 41:37.170
The future is full of uncertainties.

41:37.655 --> 41:39.980
But no matter what the future holds,

41:40.830 --> 41:42.130
remember one thing.

41:43.705 --> 41:44.455
North Liang

41:44.530 --> 41:45.955
is expecting our return.

42:07.605 --> 42:11.230
(End of Season 1)

42:51.505 --> 42:54.441
(The journey is long,
but you'll get there.)

42:54.465 --> 42:57.581
(Persevere on the way,
the future is full of hope.)

42:57.605 --> 43:00.861
(Wish all the travelers
know their ways back home.)

43:00.885 --> 43:04.456
(Wish all the lost ones
find their paths to the future.)

43:04.480 --> 43:07.710
(Wish to meet again
even though we bid farewell.)

43:07.734 --> 43:10.731
(Every ending is a rebirth.)

43:10.755 --> 43:13.680
(See you someday in the future.)

43:42.905 --> 43:45.625
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:47.405 --> 43:50.205
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:52.305 --> 43:55.225
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:56.105 --> 43:59.905
♪ That you'll answer ♪

44:01.305 --> 44:04.205
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

44:06.055 --> 44:08.875
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

44:10.755 --> 44:13.510
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:14.505 --> 44:18.430
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:18.880 --> 44:21.611
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:21.635 --> 44:22.875
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:23.655 --> 44:27.515
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:28.355 --> 44:31.081
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:31.105 --> 44:32.540
♪ The vanity ♪

44:33.005 --> 44:36.880
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:37.255 --> 44:38.606
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:38.630 --> 44:41.465
♪ It's enough ♪

44:41.850 --> 44:44.331
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:44.355 --> 44:46.755
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:47.155 --> 44:49.181
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:49.205 --> 44:51.381
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:51.405 --> 44:55.620
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:55.645 --> 44:56.781
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:56.805 --> 44:59.845
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

45:00.270 --> 45:02.231
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

45:02.255 --> 45:05.220
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

45:05.545 --> 45:07.361
♪ If there is a way ♪

45:07.385 --> 45:09.881
♪ To start over ♪

45:09.905 --> 45:14.005
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
